Oh, the bloody Maniac guide strikes again.

Monster difficulty is the average of depth and experience level. Hence
lingering on an explored level, gaining XL without finding new equipment,
is one of the worst things you can do. _Never_ linger on an explored level
because of preconceived ideas about XL versus depth.

